    "description": {
      "value": "The cuirass of this +1 deathless (see above) resilient leather armor, stitched to resemble an Osiriani scarab beetle, feels strangely chitinous. You gain resistance 5 to negative damage.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n\nYou cast a 1st-level pest form. You can only become a scarab beetle.\n\n**Craft Requirements:** Supply one casting of pest form."
